WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.770
- Lemme guess, those are case numbers

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:17.730
from every rape that's
happened in the county?

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:18.690
- State.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.830
- Within the last three years?

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:22.663
- Five.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:27.018
- Bitch, you are on your game.

00:00:27.018 --> 00:00:29.601
(solemn music)

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.370
- Unbelievable is a story
about a rape investigation

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:36.560
gone horribly wrong

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:39.933
and then a rape investigation
gone brilliantly right.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:26.190
- In Marie's case, she got
interviewed several times

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:29.210
and I think it was almost
like she was being attacked

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:30.493
over and over again.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.593
- So basically, you were assaulted twice.

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:57.363
Once by your attacker,
then again by the police.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.280
- Yeah, I guess.

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:03.980
- I am so sorry, Marie.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:05.120
- It's not your fault.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:08.873
- It's brave of you to
revisit it, that's not easy.

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:12.350
Thank you for trusting me.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.050
- She just moved into her place

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.670
like a couple of months before,

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:54.810
she wakes up in the middle of the night

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:56.550
with this weight on her back,

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.320
it's a man on top of her,

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.140
pins her arms, tells her he's got a gun,

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:01.740
he's gonna use it if she
gives him any trouble.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:02.640
- When was this?

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.293
- 22nd, about a month ago.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:10.220
He proceeds to rape her
for three hours on and off.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:11.523
I mean.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.913
- Same thing with my victim.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.493
Stopping and starting for four hours.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:19.613
- Huh.

00:03:20.535 --> 00:03:23.118
(solemn music)

00:04:19.983 --> 00:04:21.740
- We felt a great deal of responsibility

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.950
in telling this story.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:26.040
One case where there was a
real miscarriage of justice

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.710
and one case where two cops,
who happened to be women,

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.240
got it right and ultimately,

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:35.423
their good work changes the life of Marie.

